          "The evidence text has already been PII-redacted. Do NOT invent facts, tracking numbers, or dates not present in the provided context.",
          "Similar past dispute cases are provided as context — use their outcomes to inform your win probability estimate, but note the current dispute's tenant context is isolated.",
          "Return a strictly validated JSON object with these fields: winProbabilityPercent (0-100), evidenceStrengthScore (0-100), recommendedAction (SUBMIT_DEFENSE | ACCEPT_DISPUTE | GATHER_MORE_EVIDENCE), reasonClassification (string), applicableCompellingEvidenceRule (string), strengths (string[]), vulnerabilities (string[]), missingEvidenceRecommendations (array of {type, title, impact, reason}), suggestedRebuttalLetter (formal professional rebuttal citing only verified facts).",
